  << /ActualText (Aarav Singh moved from India to Canada during high school and now lives in Burnaby\056 He is studying automotive service technology because he enjoys learning by doing\054 and sees trades as a practical way to build a secure future in Canada\056 He is motivated by the chance to support his family\054 gain independence\054 and contribute to his community\054 but he still looks for tools that can help him fully understand industry\055specific language and workplace communication\056 Although Aarav is fluent in English\054 he struggles with trade\055specific jargon\054 especially safety terms and instructions\054 which may affect his safety at work\056)
